soit 2' de bonus !)* activement afin de pouvoir repartir sur le second bloc avec autant d'intensité que sur le premier.","displayName":"Endurance de Force","coachAdvice":"Si tu fais tes séances de sprints toujours au même endroit, prends des repères. Tu devrais savoir quelle distance tu es capable d'atteindre en fonction du nombre de secondes. Et semaine après semaine, essaie de repousser cette distance.","test":false,"importance":true,"trainingType":"Intensity","trainingCategory":"road_intensity","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"WU_20","exerciseType":"warm-up","pace":{"name":"EF","value":328,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":20,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"warm-up"},{"repeat":2,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"ENDU_FORCE_40","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Rapide","value":193,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z5","abstract":true,"slug":"fast"},"durations":[{"value":40,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recuppassive_3","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Lent","value":599,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"slow"},"durations":[{"value":180,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"ENDU_FORCE_30","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Rapide","value":193,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z5","abstract":true,"slug":"fast"},"durations":[{"value":30,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recuppassive_3.2","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Lent","value":599,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"slow"},"durations":[{"value":180,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"ENDU_FORCE_20","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Rapide","value":193,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z5","abstract":true,"slug":"fast"},"durations":[{"value":20,"timeUnit":"s