{"kind":"GPP","duration":120},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120}],"gear":["weights"],"duration":{"value":30,"timeUnit":"minutes"}},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"EF_40","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale. Le but n'est pas de courir pile au milieu de la fourchette d'allure donnée, mais de faire au mieux en fonction de la forme du jour. Si tu mesures ton cardio, reste en-dessous des 75% de ta Fréquence Cardiaque Maximale, c'est la limite de l'endurance fondamentale.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"Comment minimiser ta progression ? À cause de footings courus trop rapidement et qui génèrent une fatigue qui va s'ajouter à celle des entraînements fractionnés ! Le programme qu'on te donne a été étudié pour que ces séances soient courues à allure lente, sinon la charge d'entraînement va être trop forte et tu vas soit te blesser, soit t'entraîner plus fort que ce que ton corps peut accepter... et donc ne pas progresser !","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_40","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":328,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":40,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":1,"weekDate":1787529600000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":6.997084548104956,"expectedDuration":2400},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":2400,"pace":{"value":328}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"S60_600_1","description":"Séance de seuil 60' où tu vas enchaîner **6 répétitions de 3'** à l'allure cible entrecoupées de 1'30 de footing lent pour récupérer.","displayName":"Seuil 60","coachAdvice":"On attaque le seuil 60 aujourd'hui, l'allure que tu serais capable de tenir pendant 60 minutes au total si tu étais 100% reposé(e) et en fin de préparation. On n'en est pas encore là, mais on va t'y emmener progressivement. Aujourd'hui, ça ne devrait pas te sembler trop dur normalement, cette allure étant assez agréable quand on ne cherche pas à la tenir trop longtemps.","test":false,"importance":true,"trainingType":"Intensity","trainingCategory":"road_intensity","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"WU_15","exerciseType":"warm-up","pace":{"name":"EF","value":328,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":15,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"warm-up"},{"repeat":6,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"S60_3","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Seuil 60","value":255,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z4","abstract":false,"slug":"seuil60"},"durations":[{"value":3,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recup_1.5","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Lent","value":598,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"slow"},"durations":[{"value":90,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"CD_5","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"EF","value":328,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":5,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"cool-down"}],"difficulty":3,"trainingIndex":2,"weekDate":1787529600000,"status":"todo","nutritionTraining":{"_id":"6a674f2eba63bbdf0c9d0f3d","userId":"642ab60364e5867bee895c04","weekDate":1787529600000,"sessionIndex":2,"choRecommendation":3,"formSuggestions":["liquid","semi-liquid"],"recipeOptions":{"1":{"homemade":[[{"datoId":"fV5sxS6dTOmJgqP6qnmqoA","name":"Velouté de tomates spécial effort","form":"liquid","info":{"quantity":{"value":600,"metric":"mL"},"cho":{"value