te ! Ça fait du bien de te recentrer sur les petits plaisirs simples de temps en temps ! :)","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_40","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":40,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":4,"weekDate":1788134400000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":7.017543859649122,"expectedDuration":2400},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":2400,"pace":{"value":327}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"SL_90_HARD_1","description":"Sortie longue en endurance fondamentale avec un bloc actif **FACULTATIF** en deuxième moitié de sortie (en cas de fatigue excessive, douleur, manque d'envie...). Le bloc actif est composé de 2 séries de 15' Tempo, séparées par 2' de repos.","displayName":"Sortie Longue & Active","coachAdvice":"1h30 de sortie longue, c'est la sortie longue \"classique\". Le bon compromis entre fatigue et développement de l'endurance. Cependant, ta préparation marathon t'amènera bien au-delà dans les mois à venir !","test":false,"importance":true,"trainingType":"SL","trainingCategory":"road_long_run","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"WU_45","exerciseType":"warm-up","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":45,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"warm-up"},{"repeat":2,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Tempo_15","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Tempo","value":299,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z3","abstract":false,"slug":"tempo"},"durations":[{"value":15,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recup_2","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name