Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"Le genre de sorties qui doivent se courir vraiment lentement. On ne fait pas monter le cardio, au contraire on cherche à le garder le plus bas possible. On sort juste pour se garder actif et ne pas tomber dans un état de surentraînement mais ton objectif est vraiment de récupérer avant de rattaquer un nouveau cycle d'entraînement !","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_30","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":30,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":4,"weekDate":1789344000000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":5.2631578947368425,"expectedDuration":1800},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":1800,"pace":{"value":327}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"SL_65","description":"Sortie longue à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale, comme pour les footings.","displayName":"Sortie Longue","coachAdvice":"En augmentant très progressivement la durée de la sortie longues, petit à petit, on fait tout pour t'éviter les blessures et te garantir une belle évolution dans les mois qui viennent !","test":false,"importance":true,"trainingType":"SL","trainingCategory":"road_long_run","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_65","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":65,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":5,"weekDate":1789344000000,"status":"todo","nutritionTraining":{"_id":"6a674f2eba63bbdf0c9d0f44","userId":"642ab60364e5867bee895c04","weekDate":1789344000000,"sessionIndex":5,"choRecommendation":3,"formSuggestions":["liquid","semi-liquid"],"recipeOptions":{"1