ind":"GPP","duration":120},{"kind":"GPP","duration":30},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":40},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120}],"gear":["weights"],"duration":{"value":30,"timeUnit":"minutes"}},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"EF_45","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale. Le but n'est pas de courir pile au milieu de la fourchette d'allure donnée, mais de faire au mieux en fonction de ta forme du jour. Si tu mesures ton cardio, reste en-dessous des 75% de ta Fréquence Cardiaque Maximale, c'est la limite de l'endurance fondamentale.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"Doucement mais sûrement, voilà ton objectif du jour ! Puisque je suis dans les expressions, j'y associerais le célèbre dicton : \"qui veut voyager loin ménage sa monture\"... très adapté au coureur !","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_45","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":326,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":45,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":4,"weekDate":1791158400000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":7.9178885630498534,"expectedDuration":2700},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":2700,"pace":{"value":326}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"SL_135_HARD_1","description":"Sortie longue en endurance fondamentale avec un bloc actif **FACULTATIF** en deuxième moitié de sortie (en cas de fatigue excessive, douleur, manque d'envie...). Le bloc actif est composé de 2 séries. Chaque série est constituée de 3' au SweetSpot, suivies par 10' Tempo, puis 10' d'endurance active, pour terminer avec 5' de récupération avant de commencer la série suivante.","displayName":"Sortie Longue & Active","coachAdvice":"Comment évaluer la progression de ton endurance et de ta capacité à durer sur le marathon ? Avec ce genre de sortie ! Au fur et à mesure, tu dois sentir que tu vas de plus en plus loin dans la sortie sans fatiguer... et c'est exactement l'objectif (et lorsque tu seras reposé(e) au départ du marathon, ce sera encore plus intéressant !)","test":false,"importance":true,"trainingType":"SL","trainingCategory":"road_long_run","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"WU_70","exerciseType":"warm-up","pace":{"name":"EF","value":326,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":70,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"warm-up"},{"repeat":2,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"SweetSpot_3","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Sweet spot","value":267,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z3","abstract":false,"slug":"sweet-spot"},"durations":[{"value":3,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Tempo_10","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Tempo","value":298,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z3","abstract":false,"slug":"tempo"},"durations":[{"value":10,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Aerobie_10","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Aerobie","value":316,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z3","abstract":false,"slug":"aerobie"},"durations":[{"value":10,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recup_5","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"EF","value":326,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":5,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"CD_9","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"EF","value":326,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":9,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"cool-down"}],"difficulty":3,